  "known_note": "Items listed under \"ng\" are expected to fail on that emulator version; judge.py --profile NAME exits 0 only when the failing gating items equal the list. Measured 2026-11-11 with ./build.sh output, not on hardware. A reviewer reported that melonDS master 4ce2188 already fixed melonDS #2503 (the lantern items would then pass on its GL renderers); we have NOT verified that. When a newer emulator passes an item listed here, --profile reports NEWLY PASSING and exits 1: update the profile (or add one) after checking."
